      "parameters": {
        "content": "Razorpay webhook. Workshop seats (Rs 3,999 each) go to workshop_registrations. Program and trial invoices are marked paid.\nVerify the X-Razorpay-Signature header before trusting the body (add a Crypto node, or check it in your gateway).",
